      "role": "user",
      "content": "counselors or support lines dont actually fix the math though. the numbers dont change. i look at my bank account and my rent and my bills and it's just... it's a net negative every single month. it feels less like a struggle and more like a slow, inevitable drain. like i'm just being consumed by a system that doesn't even care if i'm here or not. if the math is broken, what am i actually supposed to do with that?",
